# F-LINE RAIL (Tour level 6): the streetcar rails in Market St (the park's and UN Plaza's pieces in the
# squeezed city) pay a gap when a grind on them ends (sf-grind-fline is the grind itself). Down UN Plaza's
# Market from 8th at 5 m/s, a 50-50 on the outbound track's rail, balanced until it stalls 9.5 s later:
# BS 50-50 + F-LINE RAIL, 4,476.
park sf
cmd 0 traffic clear
cmd 0 teleport 278.8 262.3 0.05 45.1
cmd 2 set skater.vel.x 3.546
cmd 2 set skater.vel.y 3.525
hold ollie 10..20
tap grind 26
bot balance
run 1400
expect event grindStart{line=rail_264_248} within 26..30
expect event gap{id=fline_rail,gap=F-LINE RAIL,points=250} count == 1
expect event comboLanded{name=BS 50-50 + F-LINE RAIL} count == 1
expect no event bail
